  "id": "a3923e847765b88c05b0272b",
  "title": "长沙出差半周流水",
  "summary": "主要晒晒这两天的吃食",
  "content": "<p>这周又来长沙出差了。新的工作应该会经常来长沙。巧的是，长沙确实是我非常喜欢的城市。</p>\n<p>周一上午落地后第一顿就吃了衡东菜，虽说一人食，但也是点了三个菜。</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW5WrsTOWFIokXT6s4NSPeyTlyFZAFAAJCDmsbM2pgU8jBdsO4qifAAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"衡东脆肚\">\n  <p>▲ 衡东脆肚</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW5mrsTQHX9fE2GCGs0Hy7pJv1lxZWAAJDDmsbM2pgUy_4yk-_BBKOAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"衡东脆肚\">\n  <p>▲ 衡东脆肚</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW52rsTR7C5lTWQSqw54foJ2UD0jBxAAJEDmsbM2pgU5lEUWRNSSOqAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"超脆超好吃\">\n  <p>▲ 超脆超好吃</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW6GrsTTXKZw5r6Y3LIoR9ej5hzpcDAAJFDmsbM2pgU2cji1B6G4MHAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"青椒拆骨肉\">\n  <p>▲ 青椒拆骨肉</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW6WrsTUNbQHkhPsKFhkJObC7baglPAAJGDmsbM2pgU3SqJQFHhrhMAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"茶油混合丝丝纤维感的拆骨肉很好吃\">\n  <p>▲ 茶油混合丝丝纤维感的拆骨肉很好吃</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW6mrsTWOrO67Uv7C7SXcBH7IEpP-mAAJHDmsbM2pgU_iFBNI-2E3FAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"配一个小青菜\">\n  <p>▲ 配一个小青菜</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>晚上吃了家热卤菜，热卤菜本身和酸包菜粉皮这俩菜非常好吃。</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW62rsTpcPJR-_bofab1wGwLK8vahbAAJIDmsbM2pgUxWSWUYI0vp2AQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"热卤菜\">\n  <p>▲ 热卤菜</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW7GrsTqfZUKx6sKhRwmH_ZTwKjBVAAAJJDmsbM2pgU2cAATygDGrvsQEAAwIAA3cAAz0E.jpeg\" alt=\"酸包菜粉皮\">\n  <p>▲ 酸包菜粉皮</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>周二中午和同事们简单吃了个浏阳蒸菜。</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW7WrsTw5E1hz9CxGAxiOsM-6jBDlOAAJKDmsbM2pgU1YPLV2a68QuAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW7mrsTxdppN-vjyhtAAECs3lBXBoxRgACSw5rGzNqYFMBfexO_wOeGAEAAwIAA3cAAz0E.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW72rsTyEMEuJrsTyL2W25YlgYZwq2AAJMDmsbM2pgU6rDVSTeNLejAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>晚上又是自己一人食，直接去吃了非常好吃的湘潭菜，又是好吃到惊为天人，可以说和衡东土菜不相上下。</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW8GrsT1tTG-hJSyYvwFsMND3C1b5eAAJNDmsbM2pgUw21mTVgLWcXAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"酸包菜炒牛肉\">\n  <p>▲ 酸包菜炒牛肉</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW8WrsT27OIHaUjdEoNX8QIiU9mk6ZAAJODmsbM2pgU6cjmGB7l64QAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"红彤彤的贼好吃\">\n  <p>▲ 红彤彤的贼好吃</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW8mrsT3-EZUEAAUH3BZpZfLdebOwSbwACTw5rGzNqYFNH4KVmJ8b2-wEAAwIAA3cAAz0E.jpeg\" alt=\"我现在写着我都流口水\">\n  <p>▲ 我现在写着我都流口水</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW82rsT5UaKCej3sG4wkDDIxPzyK93AAJQDmsbM2pgU85bkgyrJnBuAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"紫苏牛蛙\">\n  <p>▲ 紫苏牛蛙</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW9GrsT6oCx-uvkucAAVVhbN-EkYVWxgACUQ5rGzNqYFMlsnhW-jkaYwEAAwIAA3cAAz0E.jpeg\" alt=\"这个牛蛙也是惊为天人的好吃\">\n  <p>▲ 这个牛蛙也是惊为天人的好吃</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW9WrsT7oT4fPG3wiwVWK9sxzvoe-CAAJTDmsbM2pgUz25k2EXUhWTAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"少吃碳水，把这盆青菜当主食了\">\n  <p>▲ 少吃碳水，把这盆青菜当主食了</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW9mrsT9BI3KU5-I7JddkAAXMmh2u-mwACVQ5rGzNqYFOoZktRPif9JQEAAwIAA3cAAz0E.jpeg\" alt=\"我只能说太幸福了\">\n  <p>▲ 我只能说太幸福了</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <img src=\"https://photo.lily.lat/file/AgACAgQAAyEGAASLgSpZAAIW92rsT9wH7rUr9K-XQayDfryvPc5UAAJWDmsbM2pgU7JDbgqwM-ctAQADAgADdwADPQQ.jpeg\" alt=\"光盘了！\">\n  <p>▲ 光盘了！</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>周一周二太放肆了，周三简单地控制了一下热量，早上吃了赛百味，中午浅吃了自选称重的快餐，晚上依旧赛百味。</p>",
